<section id="install" aria-labelledby="install-heading">
  <h2 id="install-heading">Install</h2>
  <p>Requires Python 3.11 or newer. Install from PyPI:</p>
  <pre><code>python -m pip install desktop-2fa</code></pre>
  <p>Or install the command-line app with pipx:</p>
  <pre><code>pipx install desktop-2fa</code></pre>
  <p>Basic usage:</p>
  <pre><code># Create a vault and add a TOTP entry
d2fa vault init
d2fa add GitHub GitHub JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP

# Generate a code
d2fa code GitHub

# List all entries
d2fa list</code></pre>
  <p><a href="/docs/install">Installation guide</a> · <a href="/docs/cli">CLI reference</a></p>
</section>